1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:02,927
♪

2
00:00:05,177 --> 00:00:07,517
( Alice murmuring )

3
00:00:07,517 --> 00:00:10,017
( chain rattles )

4
00:00:10,017 --> 00:00:12,357
( Kirito panting )

5
00:00:12,357 --> 00:00:13,517
Alice: KIRITO.

6
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:18,277
DID YOU CARRY ME
ALL THE WAY UP HERE?

7
00:00:18,277 --> 00:00:19,697
Kirito: DAMN RIGHT, I DID,

8
00:00:19,697 --> 00:00:21,617
AND IT WASN’T EASY.

9
00:00:21,617 --> 00:00:24,327
MAYBE A "THANK YOU" OR A--

10
00:00:24,327 --> 00:00:25,737
( gasps ) WH-WHAT’RE YOU DOING?

11
00:00:25,737 --> 00:00:28,037
( Alice gasps ) HOW DISGUSTING.

12
00:00:28,037 --> 00:00:29,787
YOU’RE COMPLETELY
DRENCHED IN SWEAT!

13
00:00:29,787 --> 00:00:32,577
AND YOU HAVE STAINED
MY GARMENTS!

14
00:00:32,577 --> 00:00:34,667
HOW DARE YOU FOUL THEM UP?!

15
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,167
Kirito: ARE YOU KIDDING?!

16
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:40,047
( grunts ) OW!

17
00:00:40,047 --> 00:00:41,427
( singing in Japanese )

18
00:02:10,467 --> 00:02:12,137
( chain clanking )

19
00:02:14,467 --> 00:02:17,177
( Kirito groans )

20
00:02:17,177 --> 00:02:19,057
( patting )

21
00:02:22,687 --> 00:02:24,017
Alice: WHERE IS YOUR PARTNER?

22
00:02:24,017 --> 00:02:26,357
Kirito: HEY, HIS NAME’S EUGEO.

23
00:02:26,357 --> 00:02:29,107
Alice: FINE, EUGEO.
HE IS NOT HERE.

24
00:02:30,487 --> 00:02:32,487
FROM THE CLOUDTOP GARDEN,

25
00:02:32,487 --> 00:02:34,697
THERE IS A STAIRWAY LEADING UP.

26
00:02:34,697 --> 00:02:36,657
BEFORE REACHING
THIS FLOOR, HOWEVER,

27
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:38,997
HE WOULD HAVE HAD TO FACE
OUR STRONGEST KNIGHT.

28
00:02:38,997 --> 00:02:40,707
Kirito: YEAH?
AND WHO WOULD THAT BE?

29
00:02:40,707 --> 00:02:43,207
Alice: UNCLE.

30
00:02:43,207 --> 00:02:44,787
OR, RATHER, COMMANDER BERCOULI.

31
00:02:44,787 --> 00:02:46,667
( Kirito gasps )

32
00:02:46,667 --> 00:02:48,627
OH, MAN. NOW WHAT?

33
00:02:48,627 --> 00:02:50,337
( sighs )

34
00:02:50,337 --> 00:02:52,467
♪

35
00:02:52,467 --> 00:02:53,637
I KNOW.

36
00:02:53,637 --> 00:02:55,467
SYSTEM CALL.

37
00:02:56,847 --> 00:02:58,767
GENERATE UMBRA ELEMENT.

38
00:02:58,767 --> 00:03:00,557
ADHERE POSSESSION.

39
00:03:00,557 --> 00:03:04,517
OBJECT I.D. WLSS703.

40
00:03:04,517 --> 00:03:05,937
DISCHARGE.

41
00:03:05,937 --> 00:03:08,897
Alice: WHAT ARE YOU
DOING THAT FOR?

42
00:03:08,897 --> 00:03:12,107
Kirito: I’M TRYING TO FIND
WHERE THE BLUE ROSE SWORD’S AT.

43
00:03:12,107 --> 00:03:14,447
IF I CAN FIND IT,
I’M GONNA FIND HIM.

44
00:03:16,777 --> 00:03:17,787
HE’S UNDER US.

45
00:03:20,327 --> 00:03:21,747
- Alice: ONE MOMENT.
- Kirito: EH?

46
00:03:23,457 --> 00:03:25,247
Alice: YOU DID THIS, I TAKE IT?

47
00:03:25,247 --> 00:03:26,377
Kirito: YEAH.

48
00:03:26,377 --> 00:03:28,707
I MANAGED TO STOP THE BLEEDING,

49
00:03:28,707 --> 00:03:31,087
BUT MY SACRED ARTS
CAN ONLY DO SO MUCH.

50
00:03:32,877 --> 00:03:35,297
DO YOU THINK
YOU CAN HEAL YOUR EYE YOURSELF?

51
00:03:40,637 --> 00:03:44,767
Alice: NOT NOW. THERE IS NOT
ENOUGH SACRED POWER IN THE AIR.

52
00:03:44,767 --> 00:03:47,897
I CANNOT REPAIR IT
UNTIL SOLUS HAS RISEN.

53
00:03:47,897 --> 00:03:50,107
I AM STILL FEELING SOME PAIN,

54
00:03:50,107 --> 00:03:53,027
AND DEPTH PERCEPTION
WILL BE AN ISSUE,

55
00:03:53,027 --> 00:03:55,237
BUT NEITHER
WILL KEEP ME FROM FIGHTING.

56
00:03:55,237 --> 00:03:56,697
Kirito: A-ARE YOU SURE?

57
00:03:56,697 --> 00:03:57,947
Alice: YES.

58
00:03:57,947 --> 00:04:01,157
I WISH TO FEEL THIS PAIN.

59
00:04:01,157 --> 00:04:04,747
IT IS THE PROOF OF MY RESOLVE
TO FIGHT THE CHURCH.

60
00:04:05,827 --> 00:04:06,747
I AM FINE.

61
00:04:08,337 --> 00:04:09,377
Kirito: OKAY.

62
00:04:15,467 --> 00:04:16,887
I GET IT.

63
00:04:16,887 --> 00:04:18,597
AND, IF WE’RE EVER IN BATTLE,

64
00:04:18,597 --> 00:04:21,177
I’LL MAKE SURE
TO PROTECT YOUR RIGHT.

65
00:04:24,687 --> 00:04:26,147
( chuckles )

66
00:04:35,317 --> 00:04:37,027
( ice crunching underfoot )

67
00:04:37,027 --> 00:04:40,987
Alice: IS EUGEO
THE ONE RESPONSIBLE FOR THIS?

68
00:04:40,987 --> 00:04:42,947
Kirito: I’M PRETTY SURE
IT WAS HIM. I MEAN...

69
00:04:42,947 --> 00:04:46,827
REMEMBER HOW HE ACTIVATED
PERFECT CONTROL ON US BEFORE?

70
00:04:46,827 --> 00:04:50,747
TO BE HONEST, I DIDN’T THINK
IT WAS THIS POWERFUL.

71
00:04:50,747 --> 00:04:52,167
( Alice gasps )

72
00:04:52,167 --> 00:04:53,547
- IT CAN’T BE.
- Kirito: HUH?

73
00:04:53,547 --> 00:04:54,257
Alice: UNCLE!

74
00:04:56,717 --> 00:04:57,587
Kirito: WHAT THE...

75
00:04:57,587 --> 00:04:59,337
♪

76
00:05:01,557 --> 00:05:02,677
Alice: UNCLE.

77
00:05:06,017 --> 00:05:08,847
Kirito: NO WAY.
EUGEO DIDN’T DO THAT TO HIM.

78
00:05:08,847 --> 00:05:10,897
( Alice sniffs ) HE DID NOT,

79
00:05:10,897 --> 00:05:12,857
BUT I HAVE AN IDEA WHO DID.

80
00:05:12,857 --> 00:05:17,907
YEARS AGO, UNCLE TOLD ME
THAT PRIME SENATOR CHUDELKIN

81
00:05:17,907 --> 00:05:21,577
HAD BEEN GRANTED THE AUTHORITY
TO TURN ANYONE TO STONE,

82
00:05:21,577 --> 00:05:24,037
AN ART CALLED DEEP FREEZE.

83
00:05:24,037 --> 00:05:27,957
Kirito: REALLY? BUT THEY’RE
SUPPOSED TO BE ON THE SAME SIDE.

84
00:05:27,957 --> 00:05:29,827
WHY WOULD HE BETRAY
ONE OF HIS OWN KNIGHTS?

85
00:05:29,827 --> 00:05:31,787
DOESN’T MAKE SENSE.

86
00:05:31,787 --> 00:05:34,667
Alice: I THINK UNCLE
SECRETLY HARBORED DOUBTS

87
00:05:34,667 --> 00:05:37,127
ABOUT THE ORDERS
ISSUED BY THE SENATE,

88
00:05:37,127 --> 00:05:41,177
AND YET, LIKE MYSELF,
HE BELIEVED THERE COULD BE

89
00:05:41,177 --> 00:05:44,677
NO PEACE IN THE REALM
WITHOUT THE RULE OF THE CHURCH,

90
00:05:44,677 --> 00:05:47,767
SO HE CONTINUED TO PERFORM
HIS DUTIES REGARDLESS.

91
00:05:47,767 --> 00:05:49,727
( sobs )

92
00:05:49,727 --> 00:05:51,687
( stone creaking )

93
00:05:51,687 --> 00:05:56,107
THE SENATOR MAY HAVE
ALL THE AUTHORITY, BUT THIS?

94
00:05:56,107 --> 00:05:59,447
THERE IS NO REASON
TO TREAT HIM SO HORRIBLY, NONE!

95
00:06:00,567 --> 00:06:02,407
UNCLE!

96
00:06:02,407 --> 00:06:04,077
( crying )

97
00:06:07,657 --> 00:06:08,827
( gasps )

98
00:06:08,827 --> 00:06:11,037
UNCLE!

99
00:06:11,037 --> 00:06:13,337
NO, YOU MUSTN’T TRY TO MOVE!

100
00:06:13,337 --> 00:06:16,127
YOU’LL DESTROY YOURSELF!
STOP IT!

101
00:06:17,917 --> 00:06:20,007
( Bercouli sighs )

102
00:06:20,007 --> 00:06:22,587
HEY, LITTLE GIRL.

103
00:06:22,587 --> 00:06:25,007
WHY DON’T YOU
CUT OUT THAT CRYIN’?

104
00:06:25,007 --> 00:06:27,017
A SMILE SUITS YOU BETTER.

105
00:06:27,017 --> 00:06:28,927
( Alice gasps ) UNCLE.

106
00:06:28,927 --> 00:06:31,517
Bercouli: LOOK AT YOU.

107
00:06:31,517 --> 00:06:35,267
I GUESS YOU MADE IT
OVER THAT WALL, KIDDO.

108
00:06:35,267 --> 00:06:39,777
FOR 300 YEARS, I TRIED
AND COULDN’T BREAK THE SEAL,

109
00:06:39,777 --> 00:06:41,357
BUT YOU DID.

110
00:06:41,357 --> 00:06:43,027
Alice: WHAT DO I DO?

111
00:06:43,027 --> 00:06:45,077
I CAN’T JUST LEAVE YOU HERE.

112
00:06:45,077 --> 00:06:47,997
Bercouli:
DON’T YOU FUSS OVER ME.

113
00:06:47,997 --> 00:06:50,037
I’M HAPPY FOR YOU.

114
00:06:50,037 --> 00:06:52,747
YOU’RE STRONGER THAN EVER.

115
00:06:52,747 --> 00:06:55,417
THERE’S NOTHING LEFT
FOR ME TO TEACH YOU.

116
00:06:55,417 --> 00:06:56,747
Alice: WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?

117
00:06:56,747 --> 00:06:58,337
THAT IS NOT TRUE!

118
00:06:58,337 --> 00:07:00,627
THERE IS STILL MUCH
I NEED TO LEARN FROM YOU!

119
00:07:00,627 --> 00:07:03,337
Bercouli: YOU KNOW ALL YOU NEED.

120
00:07:03,337 --> 00:07:07,677
IF ANYONE CAN GUIDE THIS WORLD
TO WHERE IT OUGHT TO BE,

121
00:07:07,677 --> 00:07:08,677
IT’S YOU.

122
00:07:10,517 --> 00:07:12,517
HEYA, PUNK.

123
00:07:12,517 --> 00:07:15,977
LOOK AFTER HER FOR ME.

124
00:07:15,977 --> 00:07:16,857
( Kirito grunts )

125
00:07:16,857 --> 00:07:17,937
YOU GOT IT.

126
00:07:17,937 --> 00:07:19,397
( stone cracking )

127
00:07:19,397 --> 00:07:20,857
( Bercouli chuckles )

128
00:07:20,857 --> 00:07:23,737
YOU WANNA FIND YOUR PARTNER.

129
00:07:23,737 --> 00:07:27,577
PRIME SENATOR CHUDELKIN,
HE TOOK HIM.

130
00:07:27,577 --> 00:07:28,987
( Kirito gasps )

131
00:07:28,987 --> 00:07:32,537
Bercouli: HEADING
TO THE PONTIFEX’S CHAMBER.

132
00:07:32,537 --> 00:07:36,127
HURRY, BEFORE THE KID
GETS TRAPPED

133
00:07:36,127 --> 00:07:40,917
IN THE MAZE OF HIS MEMORIES.

134
00:07:40,917 --> 00:07:41,587
( Alice gasps )

135
00:07:43,837 --> 00:07:45,427
THANK YOU, UNCLE.

136
00:07:45,427 --> 00:07:47,007
( tone chimes )

137
00:07:47,007 --> 00:07:47,927
Kirito: HUH?

138
00:07:53,847 --> 00:07:55,227
NO WAY.

139
00:08:02,107 --> 00:08:03,487
( grunts )

140
00:08:05,567 --> 00:08:07,197
- ( tone chimes )
- ( Alice gasps )

141
00:08:07,197 --> 00:08:08,907
♪

142
00:08:12,327 --> 00:08:15,747
SOME HAVE TRIED
TO WIELD TWO SWORDS BEFORE,

143
00:08:15,747 --> 00:08:19,037
MOSTLY PRETENTIOUS UPPER-CLASS
NOBLEMEN LOOKING TO IMPRESS.

144
00:08:19,037 --> 00:08:21,917
YOU, ODDLY ENOUGH,
SEEM RATHER IMPOSING.

145
00:08:21,917 --> 00:08:24,377
( Kirito gasps )
OH, YOU THINK?

146
00:08:24,377 --> 00:08:27,047
I CAN’T IMAGINE FIGHTING
WITH TWO SWORDS, THOUGH.

147
00:08:27,047 --> 00:08:28,847
THAT’D BE CRAZY.

148
00:08:30,507 --> 00:08:32,217
Alice: ALL RIGHT.

149
00:08:32,217 --> 00:08:37,727
BY ALL ACCOUNTS, WE MUST ASSUME
THE PONTIFEX HAS EUGEO BY NOW.

150
00:08:37,727 --> 00:08:40,647
WHEN SHE SPEAKS,
ONE CANNOT RESIST.

151
00:08:40,647 --> 00:08:42,937
HER WORDS ARE A WEB
WHICH ENTANGLE THE MIND.

152
00:08:42,937 --> 00:08:44,947
Kirito:
LIKE SOME KIND OF HYPNOTIST.

153
00:08:44,947 --> 00:08:45,817
YOU TALK TO HER BEFORE?

154
00:08:45,817 --> 00:08:47,857
♪

155
00:08:47,857 --> 00:08:48,657
Alice: ONLY ONCE.

156
00:08:50,027 --> 00:08:52,197
IT WAS SIX YEARS AGO.

157
00:08:52,197 --> 00:08:55,907
I REMEMBER WAKING UP AND
THE PONTIFEX STANDING BEFORE ME.

158
00:08:55,907 --> 00:08:59,667
SHE SAID SHE RULED THE HUMAN
EMPIRE ON BEHALF OF THE GODS

159
00:08:59,667 --> 00:09:02,797
AND HAD SUMMONED ME
TO SERVE THEIR WILL.

160
00:09:02,797 --> 00:09:06,467
HER EYES WERE LIKE MIRRORS,
SILVER AND REFLECTIVE.

161
00:09:06,467 --> 00:09:10,257
I DID NOT REALIZE IT
AT THE TIME, BUT I DO NOW.

162
00:09:10,257 --> 00:09:15,057
I WAS TERRIFIED OF HER,
AND I KNEW I COULD NOT DEFY HER.

163
00:09:15,057 --> 00:09:17,477
I WOULD ACCEPT
EVERY WORD SHE SAID

164
00:09:17,477 --> 00:09:20,227
AND SERVE HER
WITH ALL OF MY BEING.

165
00:09:20,227 --> 00:09:24,277
THE FEAR WAS ABSOLUTE.
IT COMPELLED ME TO OBEY,

166
00:09:24,277 --> 00:09:25,857
AND, LIKE A COWARD, I DID.

167
00:09:26,947 --> 00:09:27,947
Kirito: ALICE.

168
00:09:27,947 --> 00:09:31,777
( Alice sighs )

169
00:09:31,777 --> 00:09:33,197
NOT TO WORRY.

170
00:09:33,197 --> 00:09:35,787
I KNOW WHAT I MUST DO NOW.

171
00:09:35,787 --> 00:09:38,617
FOR THE SAKE OF MY SISTER
LIVING IN THE NORTH,

172
00:09:38,617 --> 00:09:42,127
FOR MY FAMILY AND THE CITIZENS
OF THIS REALM,

173
00:09:42,127 --> 00:09:44,167
I WILL DO
WHAT I BELIEVE IS RIGHT.

174
00:09:44,167 --> 00:09:46,797
WE MUST HURRY.

175
00:09:46,797 --> 00:09:50,837
TIME IS SHORT, AND WE STILL
HAVE TO REACH THE PONTIFEX.

176
00:09:50,837 --> 00:09:54,137
THE PRIME SENATOR WILL TRY
TO STOP US, SO PREPARE YOURSELF.

177
00:09:54,137 --> 00:09:56,177
Kirito: W-WAIT.
WHAT ABOUT THE COMMANDER?

178
00:09:56,177 --> 00:09:58,637
WE CAN’T LEAVE HIM LIKE THIS.

179
00:09:58,637 --> 00:10:00,227
Alice: IF WE CATCH CHUDELKIN,

180
00:10:00,227 --> 00:10:02,807
WE CAN FORCE HIM
TO REVERSE THE SPELL.

181
00:10:02,807 --> 00:10:05,817
OR WE CAN KILL HIM
AND SOLVE THE PROBLEM THAT WAY.

182
00:10:05,817 --> 00:10:07,437
( Kirito chuckles )

183
00:10:09,277 --> 00:10:11,527
- HEY.
- Alice: YES?

184
00:10:11,527 --> 00:10:14,947
Kirito: YOU MENTIONED
THIS PRIME SENATOR CHUDELKIN GUY

185
00:10:14,947 --> 00:10:18,497
A FEW TIMES, BUT WHAT’S THE DEAL
WITH THE OTHER SENATORS?

186
00:10:18,497 --> 00:10:22,077
Alice: TO BE HONEST,
NONE OF US INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

187
00:10:22,077 --> 00:10:24,707
HAVE EVER SEEN
THE OTHER SENATORS.

188
00:10:24,707 --> 00:10:27,917
I KNOW THEY ARE LOCATED
ABOVE THE 96th FLOOR.

189
00:10:27,917 --> 00:10:30,757
WE KNIGHTS ARE
NOT ALLOWED THERE, THOUGH.

190
00:10:30,757 --> 00:10:32,337
Kirito: YOU KNOW
WHAT THESE SENATORS DO?

191
00:10:32,337 --> 00:10:34,807
Alice: THEY MONITOR THE REALM.

192
00:10:34,807 --> 00:10:36,767
FROM THEIR CHAMBER,

193
00:10:36,767 --> 00:10:39,887
THEY OBSERVE THE WORDS AND DEEDS
OF EVERY CITIZEN

194
00:10:39,887 --> 00:10:43,017
TO ENSURE THEY ARE
NOT VIOLATING THE TABOO INDEX.

195
00:10:43,017 --> 00:10:46,977
WHEN SOMEONE
RUNS AFOUL OF THE TABOOS,

196
00:10:46,977 --> 00:10:50,697
THEY NOTE THE VIOLATION AND
SEND A KNIGHT TO DEAL WITH IT.

197
00:10:50,697 --> 00:10:53,157
Kirito: SO BASICALLY
THEY’RE PRETTY MUCH

198
00:10:53,157 --> 00:10:55,487
THE EYES AND EARS
OF THE PONTIFEX.

199
00:10:55,487 --> 00:10:58,287
ALTHOUGH, IF ADMINISTRATOR’S
A CONTROL FREAK,

200
00:10:58,287 --> 00:11:00,747
IT’S HARD TO BELIEVE SHE’D
GIVE ANYONE THAT MUCH AUTHORITY.

201
00:11:04,167 --> 00:11:06,627
IS THIS WHERE THEY ARE?

202
00:11:06,627 --> 00:11:08,837
Alice: YES, IT SHOULD BE.

203
00:11:08,837 --> 00:11:11,047
♪

204
00:11:12,337 --> 00:11:13,637
( Kirito grunts )

205
00:11:13,637 --> 00:11:15,347
( door seal hisses )

206
00:11:15,347 --> 00:11:17,217
( soft chatter )

207
00:11:18,307 --> 00:11:20,727
Alice: THAT IS A SACRED ART!

208
00:11:20,727 --> 00:11:22,807
Kirito: DOESN’T SOUND
LIKE AN ATTACK SPELL.

209
00:11:24,267 --> 00:11:25,857
Alice: ARE YOU READY?

210
00:11:25,857 --> 00:11:27,317
Kirito: MM-HMM.

211
00:11:27,317 --> 00:11:28,897
- ( chatter continues )
- Senator: SYSTEM CALL...

212
00:11:32,067 --> 00:11:33,357
Senator 2: SYSTEM CALL...

213
00:11:33,357 --> 00:11:35,067
- ( Alice gasps )
- ( Kirito gasps )

214
00:11:35,067 --> 00:11:37,987
♪

215
00:11:37,987 --> 00:11:41,117
- Senator 3: SYSTEM CALL...
- Senator 4: ...REBELLING INDEX.

216
00:11:41,117 --> 00:11:43,077
Kirito: THEY’RE ALL JUST HEADS.

217
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:44,207
Alice: LOOK AGAIN.

218
00:11:44,207 --> 00:11:45,577
THEIR BODIES
SEEM TO BE ATTACHED.

219
00:11:45,577 --> 00:11:46,997
Senator 5:
DISPLAY REBELLING INDEX.

220
00:11:46,997 --> 00:11:49,877
Senator 6: SYSTEM CALL.

221
00:11:49,877 --> 00:11:52,717
DISPLAY REBELLING INDEX.

222
00:11:52,717 --> 00:11:54,297
- ( chatter continues )
- ( Kirito gasps )

223
00:11:54,297 --> 00:11:56,757
THAT WAS A SENATOR?

224
00:11:56,757 --> 00:11:58,677
Alice: HAVE YOU SEEN ONE BEFORE?

225
00:11:58,677 --> 00:12:01,307
Kirito: YEAH,
BACK AT THE ACADEMY,

226
00:12:01,307 --> 00:12:03,847
RIGHT AFTER WE FOUGHT
RAIOS AND HUMBERT.

227
00:12:03,847 --> 00:12:05,347
HE APPEARED OUT OF NOWHERE.

228
00:12:05,347 --> 00:12:07,937
( alarm and bell ringing )

229
00:12:07,937 --> 00:12:09,267
( chatter stops )

230
00:12:18,237 --> 00:12:19,907
( alarm and bell stop )

231
00:12:19,907 --> 00:12:21,037
( both gasp )

232
00:12:21,037 --> 00:12:24,157
♪

233
00:12:24,157 --> 00:12:25,787
( senators gulping )

234
00:12:36,007 --> 00:12:37,467
Senator 7: SYSTEM CALL.

235
00:12:37,467 --> 00:12:39,547
- DISPLAY REBELLING INDEX.
- ( chatter resumes )

236
00:12:41,507 --> 00:12:45,267
Alice: THESE MISERABLE CREATURES
ARE THE SENATORS?

237
00:12:45,267 --> 00:12:47,147
WHAT A HORRIFYING FATE.

238
00:12:47,147 --> 00:12:48,857
DID THE PONTIFEX DO THIS?

239
00:12:48,857 --> 00:12:50,817
Kirito: YEAH, THAT’S MY BET.

240
00:12:50,817 --> 00:12:52,727
THESE WERE ONCE NORMAL PEOPLE,

241
00:12:52,727 --> 00:12:55,277
PROBABLY GOOD
AT THE SACRED ARTS, TOO.

242
00:12:55,277 --> 00:12:57,987
SHE KIDNAPPED ’EM AND
TURNED ’EM INTO THESE THINGS.

243
00:12:59,367 --> 00:13:01,327
Alice: UNFORGIVABLE.

244
00:13:01,327 --> 00:13:04,537
( Chudelkin wailing )

245
00:13:04,537 --> 00:13:08,077
NO! NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO!

246
00:13:08,077 --> 00:13:10,287
- THIS WILL NOT DO!
- Kirito: WHO’S THAT?

247
00:13:10,287 --> 00:13:13,047
( Chudelkin wails )

248
00:13:13,047 --> 00:13:15,257
Alice: THE PRIME SENATOR...

249
00:13:15,257 --> 00:13:16,677
CHUDELKIN.

250
00:13:17,877 --> 00:13:20,257
Chudelkin:
THIS CANNOT BE HAPPENING!

251
00:13:20,257 --> 00:13:21,637
( stammering )

252
00:13:24,137 --> 00:13:25,977
( wailing )

253
00:13:25,977 --> 00:13:27,387
THIS WON’T DO!

254
00:13:27,387 --> 00:13:30,437
NO, NO, NO!
IT SIMPLY WILL NOT DO!

255
00:13:30,437 --> 00:13:33,017
( yelling )

256
00:13:33,017 --> 00:13:34,147
( wailing )

257
00:13:34,147 --> 00:13:34,987
( gasps )

258
00:13:34,987 --> 00:13:37,447
♪

259
00:13:37,447 --> 00:13:40,067
( sputtering )

260
00:13:43,117 --> 00:13:45,617
( gasps )

261
00:13:45,617 --> 00:13:48,037
Alice: IF YOU ATTEMPT
TO INITIATE AN ART,

262
00:13:48,037 --> 00:13:50,077
I WILL CUT YOUR TONGUE
RIGHT OUT OF YOUR HEAD.

263
00:13:50,077 --> 00:13:51,077
( Chudelkin yelps )

264
00:13:51,077 --> 00:13:54,747
THE NERVE! WAIT JUST A MOMENT.

265
00:13:54,747 --> 00:13:57,047
YOU SHOULD HAVE DIED
IN THE FALL WITH THAT TRAITOR!

266
00:13:57,047 --> 00:13:58,427
WHY ARE YOU ALIVE,
NUMBER THIRTY?!

267
00:13:58,427 --> 00:14:00,507
Alice: I AM NOT A NUMBER!

268
00:14:00,507 --> 00:14:01,507
( exhales )

269
00:14:01,507 --> 00:14:03,887
MY NAME IS ALICE.

270
00:14:03,887 --> 00:14:06,017
I AM NO LONGER NUMBER THIRTY.

271
00:14:06,017 --> 00:14:07,477
( Chudelkin sputters )

272
00:14:07,477 --> 00:14:08,477
OH.

273
00:14:08,477 --> 00:14:10,937
YOU! WHY ARE YOU HERE?!

274
00:14:10,937 --> 00:14:13,437
NUMBER--I MEAN, ALICE,

275
00:14:13,437 --> 00:14:15,897
WHY IS YOUR SWORD
NOT EMBEDDED IN HIM?!

276
00:14:15,897 --> 00:14:18,067
DON’T YOU REMEMBER?
HE’S A HERETIC,

277
00:14:18,067 --> 00:14:21,107
A TRAITOR,
A PAWN OF THE DARK TERRITORY!

278
00:14:21,107 --> 00:14:23,577
Alice: YOU ARE RIGHT.
HE IS A TRAITOR,

279
00:14:23,577 --> 00:14:26,077
BUT HE IS NOT
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY.

280
00:14:26,077 --> 00:14:27,617
THAT, I CAN ASSURE YOU.

281
00:14:27,617 --> 00:14:29,407
( Chudelkin sputters ) YOU--

282
00:14:29,407 --> 00:14:33,077
YOU MISERABLE KNIGHT!
YOU WISH TO BETRAY US, TOO!

283
00:14:33,077 --> 00:14:36,377
WHEN I TELL YOU TO DO SOMETHING,
YOU DAMN WELL DO IT!

284
00:14:36,377 --> 00:14:39,667
YOU ARE NOTHING BUT A PUPPET!
ALL YOU KNIGHTS ARE!

285
00:14:39,667 --> 00:14:42,387
Alice: THE AXIOM CHURCH
TURNED US INTO PUPPETS.

286
00:14:42,387 --> 00:14:43,797
( Chudelkin sputters )

287
00:14:43,797 --> 00:14:45,847
Alice: YOU SEALED AWAY
OUR MEMORIES

288
00:14:45,847 --> 00:14:47,637
THROUGH THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL,

289
00:14:47,637 --> 00:14:51,187
FORCED US TO BE LOYAL TO YOU
AND THE CHURCH,

290
00:14:51,187 --> 00:14:52,767
MADE US BELIEVE THE MYTH

291
00:14:52,767 --> 00:14:55,357
THAT WE WERE KNIGHTS
SUMMONED FROM THE HEAVENS.

292
00:14:55,357 --> 00:14:56,357
( Chudelkin chuckles )

293
00:14:56,357 --> 00:14:59,687
YES, YOU ARE CORRECT.

294
00:14:59,687 --> 00:15:04,277
I REMEMBER THE DAY WE TURNED YOU
LIKE IT WAS YESTERDAY.

295
00:15:04,277 --> 00:15:07,327
YOU WERE SO YOUNG,
SO INNOCENT, SO CUTE,

296
00:15:07,327 --> 00:15:10,207
BEGGING AS TEARS
STREAMED DOWN YOUR CHEEKS.

297
00:15:10,207 --> 00:15:13,497
( imitating ) "PLEASE!
DON’T TAKE AWAY MY MEMORIES

298
00:15:13,497 --> 00:15:17,207
OF ALL THE PEOPLE I LOVE!
DON’T MAKE ME FORGET!"

299
00:15:17,207 --> 00:15:18,707
( laughing )

300
00:15:18,707 --> 00:15:21,417
WHY, JUST THINKING
ABOUT IT AGAIN IS GOING

301
00:15:21,417 --> 00:15:24,467
TO KEEP ME AWAKE ALL NIGHT,
LAUGHING HYSTERICALLY!

302
00:15:24,467 --> 00:15:27,467
AS I RECALL,
YOU WERE BROUGHT HERE

303
00:15:27,467 --> 00:15:28,847
FROM SOME BACKWATER TOWN

304
00:15:28,847 --> 00:15:31,557
AND TRAINED AS AN APPRENTICE
FOR TWO YEARS.

305
00:15:31,557 --> 00:15:34,597
YOU WERE SO REBELLIOUS!
ONCE, YOU SNUCK OUT

306
00:15:34,597 --> 00:15:38,147
TO SEE THE MIDSUMMER FESTIVAL
LIKE A TOMBOY.

307
00:15:38,147 --> 00:15:41,317
THAT SAID, YOU STUDIED HARD,
BELIEVING AGAINST ALL HOPE

308
00:15:41,317 --> 00:15:44,447
THAT, ONE DAY,
YOU’D RETURN HOME AGAIN.

309
00:15:44,447 --> 00:15:48,117
BUT YOU DIDN’T, AND THAT’S
BECAUSE, ONCE YOU RAISED

310
00:15:48,117 --> 00:15:50,697
YOUR SYSTEM CONTROL
AUTHORITY LEVEL HIGH ENOUGH,

311
00:15:50,697 --> 00:15:52,957
IT’S FORCED SYNTHESIS TIME!

312
00:15:52,957 --> 00:15:55,207
YOU SHOULD HAVE SEEN YOUR FACE

313
00:15:55,207 --> 00:15:57,457
WHEN YOU REALIZED
YOU’D NEVER SEE YOUR HOME AGAIN.

314
00:15:57,457 --> 00:15:59,917
I WANTED TO TURN YOU TO STONE

315
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:01,917
SO I COULD DISPLAY
YOUR PRECIOUS GRIEF

316
00:16:01,917 --> 00:16:03,377
IN MY CHAMBER FOREVER!

317
00:16:03,377 --> 00:16:05,087
- ( Alice gasps )
- ( Chudelkin laughs )

318
00:16:05,087 --> 00:16:06,797
( yelps )

319
00:16:06,797 --> 00:16:09,507
Alice: YOU MENTIONED
SOMETHING ODD JUST NOW.

320
00:16:09,507 --> 00:16:12,427
"FORCED SYNTHESIS"?
DO YOU MEAN TO SAY

321
00:16:12,427 --> 00:16:16,147
THE RITUAL CAN BE UNDERTAKEN
VOLUNTARILY AS WELL?

322
00:16:16,147 --> 00:16:18,977
Chudelkin: MY, MY,
WHAT SHARP EARS YOU HAVE.

323
00:16:18,977 --> 00:16:20,687
YOU’RE ABSOLUTELY CORRECT.

324
00:16:20,687 --> 00:16:25,357
SIX YEARS AGO, YOU WERE
SO UNBELIEVABLY STUBBORN.

325
00:16:25,357 --> 00:16:27,817
YOU REFUSED TO RECITE
THE SECRET COMMANDS

326
00:16:27,817 --> 00:16:30,367
FOR THE TYPICAL
SYNTHESIS RITUAL.

327
00:16:30,367 --> 00:16:33,577
HONESTLY, YOU WERE THE MOST
INSUFFERABLE BRAT IMAGINABLE.

328
00:16:33,577 --> 00:16:35,577
YOU GAVE ME NO CHOICE,

329
00:16:35,577 --> 00:16:37,627
BUT TO DIVERT
THE AUTOMATED SENATORS

330
00:16:37,627 --> 00:16:40,627
FROM THEIR NORMAL DUTIES,
THEN HAVE THEM CONDUCT A RITUAL

331
00:16:40,627 --> 00:16:44,297
TO PRY THE DOOR OPEN
TO YOUR MOST PRECIOUS MEMORIES.

332
00:16:44,297 --> 00:16:47,387
IT WAS A BOTHER,
BUT I SHOULDN’T COMPLAIN.

333
00:16:47,387 --> 00:16:49,597
I GOT TO SEE
AN INCREDIBLE SHOW!

334
00:16:49,597 --> 00:16:51,967
( laughing )

335
00:16:51,967 --> 00:16:54,557
Kirito:
HE’S TALKING WAY TOO MUCH.

336
00:16:54,557 --> 00:16:58,517
YEAH, LIKE HE’S STALLING.

337
00:16:58,517 --> 00:16:59,517
Chudelkin: HMM.

338
00:16:59,517 --> 00:17:03,317
Alice: PRIME SENATOR CHUDELKIN,

339
00:17:03,317 --> 00:17:06,647
YOU HAD A LIFETIME OF AMUSEMENT
FROM MY SUFFERING.

340
00:17:06,647 --> 00:17:09,447
NOW, AT THE END,
I HOPE YOU ARE SATISFIED.

341
00:17:09,447 --> 00:17:11,077
( Chudelkin groaning )

342
00:17:14,537 --> 00:17:18,497
Alice: I HAVE HAD ENOUGH
OF YOUR DRIVEL AND YOU.

343
00:17:18,497 --> 00:17:19,497
( Chudelkin chuckles )

344
00:17:19,497 --> 00:17:22,377
♪

345
00:17:22,377 --> 00:17:23,627
( both gasp )

346
00:17:23,627 --> 00:17:26,087
( Chudelkin laughs )

347
00:17:26,087 --> 00:17:27,427
( both coughing )

348
00:17:29,007 --> 00:17:31,507
( Chudelkin laughs )

349
00:17:31,507 --> 00:17:35,227
YOU FOOLS! THE RITUAL
IS NOT ALL I’M GOOD AT!

350
00:17:35,227 --> 00:17:36,267
( laughs )

351
00:17:36,267 --> 00:17:38,647
Alice: I WILL KILL HIM.

352
00:17:38,647 --> 00:17:40,307
Kirito: HEY! WAIT UP!

353
00:17:42,767 --> 00:17:45,777
Chudelkin: SYSTEM CALL!
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT!

354
00:17:45,777 --> 00:17:47,487
Alice: BE ON GUARD
FOR A SURPRISE ATTACK!

355
00:17:47,487 --> 00:17:48,907
Kirito: YOU GOT IT!

356
00:17:51,777 --> 00:17:53,987
Alice: HE WAS CHANTING
FROM HERE A MOMENT AGO.

357
00:17:53,987 --> 00:17:58,287
THE 100th FLOOR IS ABOVE US,
SO PERHAPS HE FLED THERE.

358
00:17:58,287 --> 00:18:02,457
Kirito: BUT HOW? I DON’T SEE
STAIRS ANYWHERE. DO YOU?

359
00:18:02,457 --> 00:18:03,537
( gasps )

360
00:18:03,537 --> 00:18:05,457
♪

361
00:18:06,667 --> 00:18:08,007
( gasps )

362
00:18:11,677 --> 00:18:13,847
GREAT. ANOTHER INTEGRITY KNIGHT.

363
00:18:13,847 --> 00:18:16,307
Alice: NO. THAT CAN’T BE.

364
00:18:16,307 --> 00:18:17,557
( Kirito gasps )

365
00:18:17,557 --> 00:18:19,727
♪

366
00:18:19,727 --> 00:18:20,647
( gasping )

367
00:18:30,447 --> 00:18:31,407
EUGEO!

368
00:18:33,027 --> 00:18:34,447
- WHAT THE HELL?
- ( Alice gasps )

369
00:18:34,447 --> 00:18:36,077
BUT HOW?

370
00:18:36,077 --> 00:18:37,077
IT’S TOO SOON.

371
00:18:37,077 --> 00:18:39,247
Kirito: TOO SOON FOR WHAT?!

372
00:18:39,247 --> 00:18:40,997
Alice: THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL.

373
00:18:42,457 --> 00:18:44,287
YOUR FRIEND EUGEO

374
00:18:44,287 --> 00:18:47,377
SEEMS TO HAVE
ALREADY BEEN SYNTHESIZED.

375
00:18:48,757 --> 00:18:50,297
Kirito: HE IS?

376
00:18:50,297 --> 00:18:51,717
NO WAY. YOU SURE?

377
00:18:51,717 --> 00:18:55,217
Alice: I AM. I DO NOT KNOW
HOW IT IS POSSIBLE.

378
00:18:55,217 --> 00:18:57,847
HE FOUGHT THE COMMANDER
ONLY AN HOUR AGO.

379
00:18:57,847 --> 00:19:01,387
Kirito: THEN, IT’S NOT POSSIBLE.

380
00:19:01,387 --> 00:19:02,647
- Alice: WAIT.
- Kirito: NOT HIM.

381
00:19:02,647 --> 00:19:04,647
Alice: WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

382
00:19:04,647 --> 00:19:06,897
DO NOT LOSE YOUR WITS NOW.

383
00:19:06,897 --> 00:19:09,487
THERE IS STILL A CHANCE
WE CAN SAVE EUGEO!

384
00:19:09,487 --> 00:19:11,237
- Kirito: THERE IS?
- Alice: YES.

385
00:19:11,237 --> 00:19:13,867
YOU TOLD ME SO YOURSELF.

386
00:19:13,867 --> 00:19:17,447
YOU DISCOVERED A WAY TO RESTORE
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT’S MEMORIES.

387
00:19:17,447 --> 00:19:20,407
THEREFORE, IT SHOULD
APPLY TO HIM AS WELL.

388
00:19:20,407 --> 00:19:22,497
THE IMPORTANT THING NOW

389
00:19:22,497 --> 00:19:24,827
IS YOU STAY CALM
AND GET HOLD OF YOURSELF.

390
00:19:24,827 --> 00:19:27,247
Kirito: YEAH. ( grunts )

391
00:19:29,587 --> 00:19:31,257
LET ME HANDLE THIS.

392
00:19:32,587 --> 00:19:34,217
Alice: AS YOU WISH.

393
00:19:34,217 --> 00:19:37,307
BE CAREFUL. HE IS NOT
THE PERSON YOU ONCE KNEW.

394
00:19:37,307 --> 00:19:38,637
Kirito: RIGHT.

395
00:19:40,977 --> 00:19:44,307
EUGEO, YOU REMEMBER WHO I AM?

396
00:19:44,307 --> 00:19:46,937
I’M KIRITO.
I’M YOUR BEST FRIEND.

397
00:19:46,937 --> 00:19:51,317
WE’VE BEEN TOGETHER EVER SINCE
WE LEFT RULID TWO YEARS AGO.

398
00:19:52,647 --> 00:19:54,197
Eugeo: I’M SORRY.

399
00:19:54,197 --> 00:19:56,197
I DON’T KNOW WHO YOU ARE.

400
00:19:56,197 --> 00:19:58,157
THANK YOU, THOUGH.

401
00:19:58,157 --> 00:19:59,867
Kirito: UH, FOR WHAT?

402
00:19:59,867 --> 00:20:02,247
Eugeo: FOR RETURNING
MY SWORD TO ME.

403
00:20:02,247 --> 00:20:03,247
Kirito: HUH?

404
00:20:03,247 --> 00:20:04,747
( tone chimes )

405
00:20:04,747 --> 00:20:05,957
( both gasp )

406
00:20:11,337 --> 00:20:12,967
Alice: INCARNATE ARMS.

407
00:20:12,967 --> 00:20:14,677
Kirito: HOW’D HE DO THAT?!

408
00:20:14,677 --> 00:20:17,387
Alice: HE USED AN ANCIENT ART
TAUGHT TO INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

409
00:20:17,387 --> 00:20:20,557
IT IS NEITHER SACRED ART,
NOR PERFECT CONTROL.

410
00:20:20,557 --> 00:20:23,977
IT ALLOWS ONE
TO MOVE OBJECTS AT WILL.

411
00:20:23,977 --> 00:20:26,307
ONLY A HANDFUL OF KNIGHTS,
INCLUDING UNCLE,

412
00:20:26,307 --> 00:20:28,437
HAVE THE SKILL
TO USE IT, THOUGH.

413
00:20:28,437 --> 00:20:30,527
IT IS NOT SOMETHING

414
00:20:30,527 --> 00:20:33,527
A NEWLY CREATED KNIGHT
LIKE EUGEO COULD HAVE MASTERED.

415
00:20:35,197 --> 00:20:38,157
Kirito: OKAY, YOU GOT IT BACK.
SO NOW WHAT?

416
00:20:38,157 --> 00:20:41,367
Eugeo: I WILL FIGHT
THE BOTH OF YOU.

417
00:20:41,367 --> 00:20:43,447
IT IS WHAT MY LADY WISHES.

418
00:20:43,447 --> 00:20:45,667
Kirito: OH, COME ON!
YOU’RE GONNA FIGHT ME,

419
00:20:45,667 --> 00:20:47,917
YOUR FRIEND,
ALL ’CAUSE SHE TOLD YOU TO?!

420
00:20:47,917 --> 00:20:49,917
THAT’S NO REASON TO FIGHT!

421
00:20:49,917 --> 00:20:52,457
Eugeo: IT IS
REASON ENOUGH FOR ME.

422
00:20:52,457 --> 00:20:55,757
SHE GIVES ME
EVERYTHING I EVER WANTED,

423
00:20:55,757 --> 00:20:58,007
AND SHE IS ALL
I’LL EVER NEED NOW.

424
00:20:58,007 --> 00:21:00,507
- Kirito: OH, GIVE ME A BREAK.
- ( Eugeo gasps )

425
00:21:00,507 --> 00:21:02,597
Kirito: WHAT ABOUT ALICE?!
DO YOU REMEMBER HER?!

426
00:21:02,597 --> 00:21:03,887
( Eugeo grunts )

427
00:21:03,887 --> 00:21:05,557
( sighs )

428
00:21:05,557 --> 00:21:09,147
I DON’T, AND I DON’T WANT TO.

429
00:21:09,147 --> 00:21:11,607
I DON’T CARE
WHO EITHER OF YOU ARE.

430
00:21:11,607 --> 00:21:12,937
I’VE HAD ENOUGH.

431
00:21:12,937 --> 00:21:14,277
Kirito: SNAP OUT OF IT.

432
00:21:14,277 --> 00:21:16,197
( boots thudding )

433
00:21:24,907 --> 00:21:27,917
Eugeo: ARM YOURSELF.
I AM DONE TALKING.

434
00:21:27,917 --> 00:21:29,497
♪

435
00:21:34,797 --> 00:21:36,877
Kirito: YOU DON’T REMEMBER,

436
00:21:36,877 --> 00:21:39,547
BUT I’M THE ONE WHO TAUGHT YOU
HOW TO FIGHT WITH A SWORD.

437
00:21:41,637 --> 00:21:43,807
KEEP THAT IN MIND,

438
00:21:43,807 --> 00:21:45,677
’CAUSE I’M ABOUT TO TEACH YOU
ANOTHER LESSON.

439
00:21:57,397 --> 00:21:58,397
( both exhale )

440
00:22:00,527 --> 00:22:02,367
( both yell )

441
00:22:05,447 --> 00:22:09,537
♪

442
00:23:36,067 --> 00:23:39,447
NEXT TIME: THE 32nd KNIGHT
